#. module: alc_eshop_cms
#: model:alc.eshop.snippet,content:alc_eshop_cms.alc_eshop_snippet_product_on_order_cancel_intro
msgid ""
"\n"
"<p>You can ask to modify the quantities in back order using the form here "
"under. You will be able to see the modification in your account, under "
"\"Product orders\", once our team will have manually modified your order.</"
"p>\n"
"<p>All questions concerning backorders can be addressed to our team by "
"phone: <strong>+32 4 338 84 39</strong> or by email: <a href=\"mailto:"
"callcenter@alcyonbelux.be\">callcenter@alcyonbelux.be</a>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<p>Vous pouvez demander une modification des quantités en backorder via le "
"formulaire ci-dessous. La modification sera visible dans votre Espace privé, "
"section \"Produits en commande\" après traitement de votre demande par notre "
"service callcenter.</p>\n"
"<p>Pour toute question concernant vos reliquats, vous pouvez contacter notre "
"service callcenter par téléphone au: <strong>+32 4 338 84 39</strong> ou par "
"mail à: <a href=\"mailto:callcenter@alcyonbelux.be\">callcenter@alcyonbelux."
"be</a>.</p>\n"

